    m_Alignment: 0
    m_AlignByGeometry: 0
    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "<b>Welcome to Vehicle Physics Pro!</b>\r\nThe most realistic and advanced
    vehicle simulation kit for Unity 3D.\r\n\r\nThis demo showcases the typical features
    in a standard car:\r\n\r\n\u2022\tAll-Wheel-Drive (AWD) vs. Two-Wheel-Drive (2WD)\n\u2022\tManual
    vs. Automatic transmission\r\n\u2022\tClutch vs. Torque Converter\r\n\u2022\tAuto-Shift
    in manual transmission\r\n\u2022\tDifferential Lock\r, three levels: axles, center,
    full\n\u2022\tEngine Stall\r\n\u2022\tDriver Assists: ABS, ESC, TCS, ASR\r\n\u2022\tSteering
    Assist\r\n\r\nMore info on Vehicle Physics Pro:\r\n\r\n    vehiclephysics.com\r\n  
    @vehiclephysics\r\n"
